<title>USA: Fort Bend County MUD 41, Texas, won by Dean Witter.</title>
<headline>Fort Bend County MUD 41, Texas, won by Dean Witter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dean Witter Reynolds, Inc said it won $1.35 mill ion of Fort Bend County Municipal Utility District No. 41, Texas, unlimited tax bonds, series 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.9477 percent.</p>
</text>
